Syntax: cast 'color spray'

Color Spray unleashes a violent cascade of clashing chromatic energies
that leap from the caster's outstretched hand. The rainbow of magical
colors sweeps across the area, striking all enemies in the vicinity with
disorienting and damaging bursts of light.

This area effect spell damages all hostile creatures in the room. The
chaotic nature of the colors makes the damage difficult to resist through
conventional means, as no single elemental protection provides immunity.

The spell is particularly disorienting to creatures with darkvision or
those accustomed to darkness, as the brilliant display overwhelms their
sensitive vision. Allies of the caster are not affected by the spray.

Color Spray is a versatile combat spell useful against multiple opponents.

See Also: ACID BLAST, MYSTIC DARTS
